          "title": "You'll want to know: সম্ভাবনা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সম্ভাবনা — sômbhābônā — \"a likelihood; a chance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আজ ঝড়ের সম্ভাবনা আছে, তাই বাইরে না গেলে ভালো। āj jhôṛer sômbhābônā āchhe, tāi bāire nā gele bhālo. There's a chance of a storm today, so it's better not to go out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সম্ভাবনা (sômbhābônā) is Sanskrit sambhāvanā, supposing or assuming (Monier-Williams), from the same root as সম্ভব, possible. Bengali uses it for how likely a thing is."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
