          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সম্ভবত (sômbhôbôtô) is Sanskrit sambhava, arising or possible (Monier-Williams), with the adverb ending -tas, in its Bengali form: 'in all likelihood'. It sits beside the taught সম্ভব."
            }
          ]
        },
