              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অনিবার্য (ônibārjô) is Sanskrit anivārya, not to be warded off, unavoidable (Monier-Williams), with the negative a- at its head: what cannot be held back. It marks the likeliest outcome of all, the one that will surely follow."
