          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ধরে নেওয়া — dhôre neoyā — \"to assume; to take for granted\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "যদি ধরে নিই যে কাল ছুটি, তাহলে আমরা কোথায় যাব? jôdi dhôre nii je kāl chhuṭi, tāhôle āmrā kothāy jābô? If we assume tomorrow is a holiday, where shall we go?"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি ধরে নিলেন যে সবাই আসবে, tini dhôre nilen je sôbāi āsbe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ধরে নেওয়া (dhôre neoyā) is ধরে, the -এ form of ধরা 'to hold' (CDIAL 6747), with নেওয়া 'to take' (CDIAL 6966): to take a thing as held, to assume it. What is assumed follows যে."
            }
          ]
        },
